{"page":142,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:111","surah":6,"ayah":111,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَوْ أَنَّنَا نَزَّلْنَآ إِلَيْهِمُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ وَكَلَّمَهُمُ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ وَحَشَرْنَا عَلَيْهِمْ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ قُبُلًا مَّا كَانُوا۟ لِيُؤْمِنُوٓا۟ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَهُمْ يَجْهَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Even if We sent the angels down to them, and the dead spoke to them, and We gathered all things right in front of them, they still would not believe, unless God so willed, but most of them are ignorant [of this].","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And (even) if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّنَا","en_gloss":"[that] We (had)","transliteration":"annanā","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَزَّلْنَآ","en_gloss":"[We] sent down","transliteration":"nazzalnā","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْهِمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ilayhimu","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikata","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَكَلَّمَهُمُ","en_gloss":"and spoken to them","transliteration":"wakallamahumu","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","en_gloss":"the dead","transliteration":"l-mawtā","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَحَشَرْنَا","en_gloss":"and We gathered","transliteration":"waḥasharnā","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُلَّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulla","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":11,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قُبُلًۭا","en_gloss":"face to face","transliteration":"qubulan","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were","transliteration":"kānū","verse_key":"6:111"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِيُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"