in the Hereafter may incline towards their deceit, be pleased with it, and so perpetrate whatever they perpetrate.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِتَصْغَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"And so that incline","transliteration":"walitaṣghā","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to it","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَفْـِٔدَةُ","en_gloss":"hearts","transliteration":"afidatu","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"in the Hereafter","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلِيَرْضَوْهُ","en_gloss":"and so that they may be pleased with it","transliteration":"waliyarḍawhu","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلِيَقْتَرِفُوا۟","en_gloss":"and so that they may commit","transliteration":"waliyaqtarifū","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُم","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّقْتَرِفُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) committing","transliteration":"muq'tarifūna","verse_key":"6:113"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١١٣","en_gloss":"(113)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:113"}]},{"verse_key":"6:114","surah":6,"ayah":114,"ar_uthmani":"أَفَغَيْرَ ٱللَّهِ أَبْتَغِى حَكَمًا وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَنزَلَ إِلَيْكُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ مُفَصَّلًا ۚ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ يَعْلَمُونَ أَنَّهُۥ مُنَزَّلٌ مِّن رَّبِّكَ بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ فَلَا تَكُونَنَّ مِنَ ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Say], ‘Shall I seek any judge other than God, when it is He who has sent down for you [people] the Scripture, clearly explained?’ Those to whom We gave the Scripture know that this [Quran] is revealed by your L