rse_key":"6:115"}]},{"verse_key":"6:116","surah":6,"ayah":116,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن تُطِعْ أَكْثَرَ مَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ يُضِلُّوكَ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ إِن يَتَّبِعُونَ إِلَّا ٱلظَّنَّ وَإِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا يَخْرُصُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you obeyed most of those on earth, they would lead you away from the path of God. They follow nothing but speculation; they are merely guessing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُطِعْ","en_gloss":"you obey","transliteration":"tuṭiʿ","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"most","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(those) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُضِلُّوكَ","en_gloss":"they will mislead you","transliteration":"yuḍillūka","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَتَّبِعُونَ","en_gloss":"they follow","transliteration":"yattabiʿūna","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلظَّنَّ","en_gloss":"[the] assumption","transliteration":"l-ẓana","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":16,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they (do)","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"6:116"},{"pos":18,"ar"